Package: cond.correct
Title: Detect and Correct Conductivity Sensor Equilibration Artifacts in Profiling Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chris", "McBride", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chris@limnotrack.com")
Description: Tools for analysing and correcting exponential equilibration
    artifacts in conductivity profile data from profiling sensor platforms.
    The conductivity cell reads high near the surface and decays exponentially
    with depth as it equilibrates. This package provides fast parameter
    estimation, temperature-aware correction (avoids flattening real
    stratification-driven conductivity structure), era detection for
    parameter changes, diagnostic plots, and a fast vectorised correction
    function suitable for use in QC pipelines.
